# HHT_TEMPLATE_PLACEHOLDER — replace all [[PLACEHOLDER ...]] copy before preflight.
# Available variables: {{publisherName}}, {{contactName}}, {{articleTitle}}, {{articleUrl}},
# {{rankingKeyword}}, {{serpPosition}}, {{city}}, {{state}}, {{targetHhtUrl}},
# {{secondaryHhtUrl}}, {{insertionSuggestion}}, {{guestPostRequirements}}.
# Empty fallback: every missing variable renders as an empty string. No subject is rendered.
# The rendered body must remain under 1,000 characters.
[[PLACEHOLDER link-insertion contact-form body.
{{contactName}} / {{publisherName}}
{{articleTitle}} {{articleUrl}}
{{rankingKeyword}} {{serpPosition}}
{{city}} {{state}}
{{targetHhtUrl}} {{secondaryHhtUrl}}
{{insertionSuggestion}}
{{guestPostRequirements}}]]
